==Trivia==
This card forms part of a {{TCGP|narrative illustration|perspective illustration}} with {{TCG ID|Mega Shine|Chatot|61}} from the same set; both cards' illustrations originated from {{TCG|DPt-P Promotional cards}}.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|DPt-P Promo|Jigglypuff|47}}, a {{TCG|DPt-P Promotional cards|DPt-P Promotional card}} only released in Japan.
*'''Stampede''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Ruby & Sapphire|Phanpy|62}} from the {{TCG|EX Ruby & Sapphire}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

